$CATEGORY: Vocabulary/HansenQuinn/4/verb

::Q001::[markdown]I have wished:{
	~%-100%λήψομαι#Incorrect. **λήψομαι** is Principal Part 2 of **λαμβάνω** “I will take” (Chapter 11).
	~%100%ἠθέληκα#Correct: **ἠθέληκα** is Principal Part 4 of **ἐθέλω** “I have wished” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%δουλεύσω#Incorrect. **δουλεύσω** is Principal Part 2 of **δουλεύω** “I will be a slave” (Chapter 6).
	~%-100%ἠξίωσα#Incorrect. **ἠξίωσα** is Principal Part 3 of **ἀξιόω** “I thought worthy of” (Chapter 10).
	~%-100%ἄρξω#Incorrect. **ἄρξω** is Principal Part 2 of **ἄρχω** “I will rule” (Chapter 5).
	~%-100%παιδεύσω#Incorrect. **παιδεύσω** is Principal Part 2 of **παιδεύω** “I will educate” (Chapter 2).
	~%-100%κεχόρευκα#Incorrect. **κεχόρευκα** is Principal Part 4 of **χορεύω** “I have danced” (Chapter 6).
	~%-100%δεδίδαγμαι#Incorrect. **δεδίδαγμαι** is Principal Part 5 of **διδάσκω** “I have been taught” (Chapter 4).
}


::Q002::[markdown]Which Principal Part of τάττω is ‘ἐτάχθην’?:{
	~%-100%2nd#Incorrect. **ἐτάχθην** is the 6th Principal Part of **τάττω**, not the 2nd.
	~%-100%4th#Incorrect. **ἐτάχθην** is the 6th Principal Part of **τάττω**, not the 4th.
	~%-100%5th#Incorrect. **ἐτάχθην** is the 6th Principal Part of **τάττω**, not the 5th.
	~%100%6th#Correct: **ἐτάχθην** is the 6th Principal Part of **τάττω** (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%3rd#Incorrect. **ἐτάχθην** is the 6th Principal Part of **τάττω**, not the 3rd.
	~%-100%1st#Incorrect. **ἐτάχθην** is the 6th Principal Part of **τάττω**, not the 1st.
}


::Q003::[markdown]Which Principal Part of τάττω is ‘ἐτάχθην’?:{
	~%100%6th#Correct: **ἐτάχθην** is the 6th Principal Part of **τάττω** (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%4th#Incorrect. **ἐτάχθην** is the 6th Principal Part of **τάττω**, not the 4th.
	~%-100%3rd#Incorrect. **ἐτάχθην** is the 6th Principal Part of **τάττω**, not the 3rd.
	~%-100%2nd#Incorrect. **ἐτάχθην** is the 6th Principal Part of **τάττω**, not the 2nd.
	~%-100%5th#Incorrect. **ἐτάχθην** is the 6th Principal Part of **τάττω**, not the 5th.
	~%-100%1st#Incorrect. **ἐτάχθην** is the 6th Principal Part of **τάττω**, not the 1st.
}


::Q004::[markdown]Which of these forms is based on the **1st Principal Part**?:{
	~%-100%Pluperfect (middle/passive)#Incorrect. **Pluperfect (middle/passive)** forms are based on the 5th Principal Part, not the 1st.
	~%-100%Pluperfect (active)#Incorrect. **Pluperfect (active)** forms are based on the 4th Principal Part, not the 1st.
	~%-100%Perfect (middle/passive)#Incorrect. **Perfect (middle/passive)** forms are based on the 5th Principal Part, not the 1st.
	~%-100%Future (passive)#Incorrect. **Future (passive)** forms are based on the 6th Principal Part, not the 1st.
	~%-100%Future (active, middle)#Incorrect. **Future (active, middle)** forms are based on the 2nd Principal Part, not the 1st.
	~%-100%Aorist (active, middle)#Incorrect. **Aorist (active, middle)** forms are based on the 3rd Principal Part, not the 1st.
	~%-100%Perfect (active)#Incorrect. **Perfect (active)** forms are based on the 4th Principal Part, not the 1st.
	~%100%Present (active, middle, passive)#Correct: **Present (active, middle, passive)** forms are based on the 1st Principal Part.
}


::Q005::[markdown]I bury:{
	~%100%θάπτω#Correct: **θάπτω** is Principal Part 1 of **θάπτω** “I bury” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%τέταχα#Incorrect. **τέταχα** is Principal Part 4 of **τάττω** “I have drawn up (in battle)” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%κεχόρευκα#Incorrect. **κεχόρευκα** is Principal Part 4 of **χορεύω** “I have danced” (Chapter 6).
	~%-100%λέλυκα#Incorrect. **λέλυκα** is Principal Part 4 of **λύω** “I have unbound” (Chapter 2).
	~%-100%ἥκω#Incorrect. **ἥκω** is Principal Part 1 of **ἥκω** “I have come” (Chapter 8).
	~%-100%ἐδήλωσα#Incorrect. **ἐδήλωσα** is Principal Part 3 of **δηλόω** “I made clear” (Chapter 10).
	~%-100%ἠξιώθην#Incorrect. **ἠξιώθην** is Principal Part 6 of **ἀξιόω** “I was thought worthy of” (Chapter 10).
	~%-100%ἐνίκησα#Incorrect. **ἐνίκησα** is Principal Part 3 of **νικάω** “I won” (Chapter 9).
}


