::Q007::[markdown]The **1st Principal Part** is the::{
	~%-100%Aorist, Active, Indicative, 1st person, Singular#Incorrect. The 1st Principal Part is **Present, Active, Indicative, 1st person, Singular**, not “Aorist, Active, Indicative, 1st person, Singular”.
	~%-100%Aorist, Passive, Indicative, 1st person, Singular#Incorrect. The 1st Principal Part is **Present, Active, Indicative, 1st person, Singular**, not “Aorist, Passive, Indicative, 1st person, Singular”.
	~%-100%Future, Active, Indicative, 1st person, Singular#Incorrect. The 1st Principal Part is **Present, Active, Indicative, 1st person, Singular**, not “Future, Active, Indicative, 1st person, Singular”.
	~%100%Present, Active, Indicative, 1st person, Singular#Correct: the 1st Principal Part is **Present, Active, Indicative, 1st person, Singular**.
	~%-100%Perfect, Middle/Passive, Indicative, 1st person, Singular#Incorrect. The 1st Principal Part is **Present, Active, Indicative, 1st person, Singular**, not “Perfect, Middle/Passive, Indicative, 1st person, Singular”.
	~%-100%Perfect, Active, Indicative, 1st person, Singular#Incorrect. The 1st Principal Part is **Present, Active, Indicative, 1st person, Singular**, not “Perfect, Active, Indicative, 1st person, Singular”.
}


